# White Nile Sugar Company — Business Process Redesign & Raybex Implementation

## Overview

A business process transformation project for White Nile Sugar Company in
Sudan, focused on redesigning existing business workflows, defining
performance indicators, and implementing the redesigned processes using
Raybex.

## My Contribution

I worked on the redesign and implementation of business processes, translating
existing operational workflows into structured processes within Raybex.

### Business Process Redesign

- Reviewed and analyzed existing business processes.
- Identified areas where workflows could be improved and structured.
- Designed new business workflows aligned with the company's operational needs.
- Mapped the redesigned processes into a structured workflow.
- Helped establish clearer responsibilities and process steps.

### KPI Development

- Defined Key Performance Indicators (KPIs) for the redesigned processes.
- Connected KPIs to the relevant business activities and workflows.
- Structured performance measures to support monitoring and evaluation.
- Helped establish a more measurable approach to process performance.

### Raybex Implementation

- Implemented the redesigned workflows within Raybex.
- Configured processes according to the newly designed business workflows.
- Integrated the defined KPIs into the system where applicable.
- Worked with the system to translate business requirements into operational
  processes.
- Supported the transition from the existing workflow structure to the
  redesigned processes.

